<div class="section content">
    <div class="columns is-variable is-8">
        <div class="column is-half">
            <h2>Architectural Precision in Retail Environments</h2>
            <p>Retail spaces sit at the intersection of architecture, interior design, and brand strategy. Photographing them means more than documenting a finished store. It requires understanding the architectural decisions behind the space and the experience it creates.</p>
            <p>My background as an architect informs every assignment. Before each shoot, I analyze geometry, circulation, materiality, and light hierarchy to produce images that reflect the project’s intent.</p>

            <p>I pay particular attention to the technical and spatial nuances unique to retail architecture:</p>

            <ul>
                <li><strong>Geometry & Proportion</strong>: Preserving vertical lines and spatial balance across wide storefronts and tight interior layouts.</li>
                <li><strong>Materiality & Craftsmanship</strong>: Accurate rendering of stone, timber, metal, glass, textiles, and bespoke joinery.</li>
                <li><strong>Light & Color Fidelity</strong>: Balancing complex ambient lighting, high-CRI display LEDs, and natural light while controlling glossy reflections.</li>
                <li><strong>Spatial Sequence & Circulation</strong>: Capturing how visitors experience, move through, and interact with the space.</li>
                <li><strong>Brand Identity</strong>: Highlighting integrated signage, display fixtures, and custom furniture details.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Luxury Retail & Flagship Store Photography</h2>

            <p>Flagship stores and luxury boutiques combine high-end architecture, tailored lighting, and brand storytelling into a coherent experience.</p>
            <p>Photographing these environments requires exceptional attention to detail. I create comprehensive photographic series combining expansive architectural views with intimate detail shots that respect both the space's architectural integrity and the brand's visual guidelines.</p>
            <p>Shoots are planned flexibly around <strong>non-trading hours</strong> such as pre-opening, evening, or night to ensure full control over lighting and composition without commercial disruption.</p>

        </div>
        <div class="column is-half">

            <h2>Commercial & Retail Typologies</h2>

            <p>I provide professional architectural photography across a range of commercial spaces in Barcelona and internationally:</p>

            <ul>
                <li><strong>Flagship Stores & Luxury Boutiques</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Commercial Showrooms & Brand Experience Centers</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Shopping Centers & Retail Developments</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Boutique Retail & Hospitality Interiors</strong></li>
                <li><strong>New Store Openings & Pop-up Environments</strong></li>
            </ul>

            <p>Each assignment is tailored to the project’s scale, whether it requires comprehensive architectural documentation, atmospheric editorial coverage, or a high-detail interior series.</p>

            <h2>Tailored Coverage for Architects, Brands, and Developers</h2>

            <p>A single retail project serves multiple communication goals depending on the stakeholder:</p>

            <ul>
                <li><strong>For Architecture & Interior Studios</strong>: High-resolution imagery optimized for <strong>architecture awards, monographs, editorial publications, and portfolio presentations</strong>.</li>
                <li><strong>For Brands & Retailers</strong>: Cohesive visual assets for web, PR, advertising campaigns, and global brand communication.</li>
                <li><strong>For Developers & Contractors</strong>: Precise visual documentation detailing construction quality, structural execution, and finished materials.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Based in Barcelona, Working Worldwide</h2>

            <p>Barcelona is my primary base, offering a rich backdrop of historic conversions, high-street luxury flagships, and modern commercial developments.</p>
            <p>From Catalonia to projects across Spain and abroad, I deliver consistent, high-end photographic representation customized to each location's architectural character.</p>

            <h2>Discuss Your Retail Project</h2>

            <p>Whether you are launching a <strong>flagship store, documenting a boutique retail interior, or submitting a commercial project for architectural awards</strong>, I offer tailored proposals based on your shot list, timing, and image licensing scope. Contact me to discuss your project.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
